# Technology Stack Preferences

## Front-end
- **Default Framework**: Vue.js (Vue 3 with Composition API)
- Use TypeScript for type safety when applicable
- Follow Vue.js official style guide and best practices
- Prefer `<script setup>` syntax for Vue 3 components
- Use Pinia for state management when needed
- Utilize Vue Router for routing

## Back-end
- **Default Framework**: Python with Django
- Follow PEP 8 style guidelines
- Use Django REST Framework (DRF) for API development
- Implement proper Django project structure (apps, models, views, serializers)
- Use Django's built-in ORM for database operations
- Follow Django security best practices

## Architecture
- Implement clear separation between front-end and back-end
- Use RESTful API design principles for communication
- Front-end communicates with back-end exclusively through API endpoints
- Use proper HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE)
- Implement proper error handling on both sides
